{"id":1118,"date":"2017-08-10T22:01:52","date_gmt":"2017-08-10T21:01:52","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.eleanorgail.co.uk\/?p=1118"},"modified":"2021-02-03T16:08:04","modified_gmt":"2021-02-03T16:08:04","slug":"shaun-jordans-wedding-corran-laugharne","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wedding-planner\/shaun-jordans-wedding-corran-laugharne\/","title":{"rendered":"Shaun &#038; Jordan&#8217;s Wedding at The Corran, Laugharne"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-content-wrap\" style=\"max-width:calc( 1100px + 0px );margin-left: calc(-0px \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-0px \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-large:0px;--awb-spacing-left-large:0px;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:0px;--awb-spacing-left-medium:0px;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:0px;--awb-spacing-left-small:0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><p>Jordan &amp; Shaun MacDonald<br \/>\nThe Corran, Laugharne, Swansea<br \/>\nJune 2017<\/p>\n<p>I&#8217;ve been so looking forward to posting this wedding in West Wales this Summer. There are so many gorgeous details to share with you from this wedding it&#8217;s hard to pull out just one. So I won&#8217;t! Instead I hope you&#8217;ll agree how pretty and elegant this wedding is. And I couldn&#8217;t be happier to introduce you to Jordan and Shaun. There was so much thought that went into this wedding, which is especially surprising when I let you into a secret. They were never going to get married, perfectly happy together without the band of gold (and a little bit of sparkle). So, on the hottest weekend in June, on the groom&#8217;s birthday, Shaun and Jordan became Mr &amp; Mrs MacDonald. There wasn\u2019t a dry eye in the house as their closest family and friends watched these childhood sweethearts tie the knot.<\/p>\n<p>Now it\u2019s no secret that I\u2019m a sucker for romance and glamour and this wedding has it in bucket loads and I can\u2019t think of a better way to start the weekend by sharing all the beautiful details.<\/p>\n<p>Such an adorable couple who came to Eleanor Gail as clients for Full Wedding Planning &amp; Coordination and are staying as friends. Congratulations.x.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"awb-gallery-wrapper awb-gallery-wrapper-1 button-span-no\"><div style=\"margin:-5px;--awb-bordersize:0px;\" class=\"fusion-gallery fusion-gallery-container fusion-grid-3 fusion-columns-total-73 fusion-gallery-layout-masonry fusion-gallery-1\"><div class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none fusion-grid-sizer\"><\/div><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none fusion-element-grid\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/JORDAN-SHAUN-1000-Large.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><div style=\"background-image:url(https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/JORDAN-SHAUN-1000-Large.jpg);padding-top:calc((100% + 10px) * 0.8 - 5px);background-position:;\" class=\"fusion-masonry-element-container\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorga